	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8412">Gaspar</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8412">Kaspar Megander</persName>.</note> mihi retulit obiter, quod nescio quas literas miseritis doctori nostro <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>de doctoratu<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Aus dem fraglichen Zeitraum ist weder ein Brief von <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName> an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> noch von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> oder den <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Pfarrern an <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadt</persName> erhalten.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod quidem si ita est, optarem vel non scriptas vel scriptas <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quam blandissime.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Homines sunt tam<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">tam <hi>übergeschrieben.</hi></note> suspicaces, ut putent, dum tale <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quid audiunt, per me moveri, cum sim tamen vel pisce magis hic mutus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Ratio est mihi in promptu, qua nugas istas vincam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hac utar, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ni deus nolit.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Per omnem vitam odivi, qui faciles erant ad male su<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>spicandum, et nunc in medio talium habito.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quamvis quo magis ad <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>hos assuesco, eo facilius possum contemnere, ut iam nihil pene sint m<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>olesti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Caeterum scripsit iterum <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Der Brief <persName ref="p5565">Capitos</persName> ist verloren.</note> monuitque, si velitis convenire, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>conveniatis alio titulo<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> titule.</note> et nomine quam eucharistiae.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Timet, i<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ntelligo, populum, ne quid mali capiat ex cognito dissidio.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Commendat <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>interea suavitatem tuam et sedulitatem, qua laboras in ecc<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>lesiarum concordia.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Intellexit enim de epistola,<pb type="edition" next="195"/> quam scripsisti <persName ref="p1391">Berch<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>toldo</persName> consolans<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Auch <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief an <persName ref="p1391">Berchtold Haller</persName> ist nicht erhalten.</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Novi nihil scribit, et miror, cum <persName ref="p8440">Gervasius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>his diebus <persName ref="p8054">Berschio</persName> nostro significant<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Der Brief von <persName ref="p8440">Gervasius Schuler</persName> an <persName ref="p8054">Markus Bertschi</persName> scheint ebenfalls verloren zu sein, sein Inhalt dürfte aber ungefähr dem Brief von <persName ref="p8440">Schuler</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> (oben <ref target="file10578">Nr. 542</ref>) entsprochen haben.</note> <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> cum <placeName ref="l2481">Svevis</placeName> consentire <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>in negocio coenae.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ad se id scripsisse <persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName> et <persName ref="p2095">Philippum</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p2095">Philipp Melanchthon</persName>.</note> clare <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dicit<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Vgl. oben <ref target="file10578">Nr. 542</ref> (Beilage).</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Unum adhuc audi: Aiunt episcopos quosdam egisse cum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>civitatibus imperialibus et <placeName ref="l2459">Rheni</placeName> quibusdam de sumptu et bello contra <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l1097">Monasterienses</placeName> atque has respondisse, quod intricarint, exedant<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. Adagia, 1, 1, 85 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 60).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sibi alia esse curanda<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Zahlreiche <placeName ref="l2459">oberrheinische</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2481">schwäbische</placeName> Städte protestierten auf dem Kreistag, der am 4. April 1535 in <placeName ref="l569">Worms</placeName> zusammengetreten war, gegen die ihnen auferlegten Kontributionen; vgl. <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> II 324-327.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Placet, si ita habet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum <persName ref="p3242">Utingero</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>fratribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, raptim, 7. aprilis anno 35.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myco.</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Dom<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
